# 🍳 Cook - 3D Kitchen Chaos Simulator

A fast-paced 3D culinary time-management simulator built in **Unity 6** using the **Universal Render Pipeline (URP)**. Take charge of a bustling kitchen, prepare fresh ingredients at dedicated stations, satisfy hungry customers across 4 live service windows, and beat the clock to achieve the ultimate high score!

